Marqdo for Ubuntu (PPA)
=======================

This package installs the marqdo CLI (/usr/bin/marqdo).

Official language extensions are not bundled. After install:

  marqdo ext add web
  marqdo ext add quantum

Extension packs download from https://ext.marqdo.com (then GitHub / proxy).

Install this package from:

  sudo add-apt-repository ppa:cflmy/marqdo
  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install marqdo

Also available: GitHub Releases (Windows/Linux zips) and building from source.

Documentation: https://github.com/cflmy/marqdo
PPA notes: doc/design/ubuntu-ppa.md in the upstream repository.
